  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think there should be a way to hide another person's group banner. They might be using an image that is anti-TOS, illegal, NSFW, triggering to people etc, so people should have an option to hide it.\n\nPutting it in the \"Hide Avatar\" button might be a solution, but adding a new \"Hide Groups Banner\" to a person's profile page (both small and big menu) might be a better solution.",
